{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type EmbeddingInputItemFor<TModalities> = \n  | string\n  | TextPart\n  | EmbeddingItemByModality[TModalities];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3087","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:3087"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Embedding item type narrowed to the modalities a specific model supports.\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"EmbeddingInputItemFor<'text'>"},{"type":"text","value":" (a text-only model) is "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string | TextPart"},{"type":"text","value":";\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'text' | 'image'"},{"type":"text","value":" additionally admits image parts and fused\n"},{"type":"link","href":"EmbeddingContentParts.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"EmbeddingContentParts"}]},{"type":"text","value":" arrays. Used by the activity option types\ntogether with the adapter's per-model modality map so unsupported inputs\nfail at compile time."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tmodalities","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TModalities"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TModalities"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"EmbeddingModality.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"EmbeddingModality"}]},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"EmbeddingModality.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"EmbeddingModality"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tmodalities","text":"TModalities","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype EmbeddingInputItemFor<TModalities> = \n  | string\n  | TextPart\n  | EmbeddingItemByModality[TModalities];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:3087](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3087)\n\nEmbedding item type narrowed to the modalities a specific model supports.\n`EmbeddingInputItemFor<'text'>` (a text-only model) is `string | TextPart`;\n`'text' | 'image'` additionally admits image parts and fused\n[EmbeddingContentParts](EmbeddingContentParts.md) arrays. Used by the activity option types\ntogether with the adapter's per-model modality map so unsupported inputs\nfail at compile time.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TModalities\n\n`TModalities` *extends* [`EmbeddingModality`](EmbeddingModality.md) = [`EmbeddingModality`](EmbeddingModality.md)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: EmbeddingInputItemFor\ntitle: EmbeddingInputItemFor\n---\n\n```ts\ntype EmbeddingInputItemFor<TModalities> = \n  | string\n  | TextPart\n  | EmbeddingItemByModality[TModalities];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:3087](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3087)\n\nEmbedding item type narrowed to the modalities a specific model supports.\n`EmbeddingInputItemFor<'text'>` (a text-only model) is `string | TextPart`;\n`'text' | 'image'` additionally admits image parts and fused\n[EmbeddingContentParts](EmbeddingContentParts.md) arrays. Used by the activity option types\ntogether with the adapter's per-model modality map so unsupported inputs\nfail at compile time.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TModalities\n\n`TModalities` *extends* [`EmbeddingModality`](EmbeddingModality.md) = [`EmbeddingModality`](EmbeddingModality.md)\n"}
